# Task 149-013: WhatsApp Scaffold (Post-Launch Activation Ready)

## Approach
Scaffold-only implementasyon. WhatsApp Business API approval gerektirir (2-6 hafta).
Resmi Business API tercih edildi — whatsapp-web.js (unofficial) TOS ihlali riski içeriyor.

## Files to Create
1. `src/connectors/whatsapp.ts` — WhatsAppConnector class (BaseConnector extend)
   - enabled=false → no-op start
   - enabled=true → activation error throw
   - sendMessage → throw (not activated)
   - isHealthy → false
2. `src/connectors/whatsapp-README.md` — Activation steps dökümantasyonu
3. `tests/connectors/whatsapp-scaffold.test.ts` — 3 test (disabled no-op, enabled error, isHealthy false)

## Design Notes
- BaseConnector.start() already handles enabled=false as no-op (line 32-35)
- WhatsApp override must NOT call super.start() for enabled=true path — we throw before
- For disabled path, we can call super.start() which handles the no-op
- isHealthy() always returns false until Sprint 152+ activation
